# Prettier's own ignores. Kept beside the config rather than in a .prettierignore
# so there is one file per tool and each says what it excludes and why.
node_modules
coverage

# The devcontainer config is JSONC — it carries comments explaining every line,
# and `//` is not valid JSON. Prettier parses it as jsonc when told to, and the
# point of the file is those comments, so it is formatted with jsonc-parser and
# never as json.
